olor:#F8F5EC;--framer-text-decoration:none;--framer-text-stroke-color:initial;--framer-text-stroke-width:initial;--framer-text-transform:none" class="framer-text"><!--$--><a class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1z089q8" data-styles-preset="JdCXtaMXO" href="#contact"><span style="--font-selector:SW50ZXItTWVkaXVt;--framer-font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;--framer-font-size:11px;--framer-font-style:normal;--framer-font-variation-axes:normal;--framer-font-weight:500;--framer-letter-spacing:0.12em;--framer-text-color:#F8F5EC" class="framer-text">CONTACT</span></a><!--/$--></p></div></div></nav><style data-framer-html-style="">html body { background: rgb(255, 255, 255); }</style><div data-framer-root="" class="framer-0zZ8p framer-72rtr7" style="min-height:100vh;width:auto;display:contents"><div class="framer-ufyued-container" data-framer-name="Immersive Portfolio Experience" name="Immersive Portfolio Experience"><div class="portfolio-root" style="height: 100%; width: 100%; position: relative; min-height: 900vh; overflow: visible; background: rgb(250, 248, 241);"><style>.hero-name-text{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;color:var(--hero-ink,#fff7e7);font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(60px,7.2vw,88px);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:0;pointer-events:auto}
.portfolio-root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:900vh;overflow:visible;isolation:isolate;color:#fffaf1;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}
nav a,nav p,nav span{color:var(--portfolio-nav-ink,#F8F5EC)!important;text-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(18,30,20,.62),0 0 10px rgba(18,30,20,.32)}
.portfolio-stage{position:sticky;top:0;height:100svh;min-height:520px;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 76% 22%,rgba(255,244,216,.9) 0%,rgba(255,250,239,.72) 30%,rgba(250,248,241,.98) 74%),#faf8f1}
.portfolio-stage:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 76% 25%,rgba(255,222,168,.18),transparent 58%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 100%,rgba(246,196,201,.08),transparent 44%);opacity:var(--sunlight-field-opacity,1);transform:scale(var(--sunlight-field-scale,1));transform-origin:76% 22%}
.portfolio-stage:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(10,25,15,.46),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(10,20,12,.28),transparent 42%);opacity:var(--meadow-shade,1)}
.meadow-layer{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;background:none;will-change:opacity}
.meadow-photo{position:absolute;inset:-2%;z-index:0;background-size:cover;background-position:center 58%;background-repeat:no-repeat;transform:scale(1);transform-origin:76% 25%;filter:none;pointer-events:none}
.grass-canvas,.ray-layer{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}
.grass-canvas{z-index:1;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.76}
.ray-layer{z-index:2;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.74}
.side-rays{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.side-rays__canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.gradient-transition{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;mix-blend-mode:screen}
.transition-optics{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:4;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;overflow:hidden}
.optic-ring{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);box-shadow:inset 0 0 28px rgba(246,196,201,.08);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.045),rgba(150,200,255,.025) 55%,transparent 72%);mix-blend-mode:screen}
.optic-ring.one{width:32vw;height:32vw;left:13%;top:12%}
.optic-ring.two{width:22vw;height:22vw;left:55%;top:38%;border-color:rgba(246,196,201,.28)}
.optic-ring.three{width:13vw;height:13vw;left:36%;top:23%;border-color:rgba(150,200,255,.3)}
.scene-content{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:5;pointer-events:none}
.hero-copy{position:absolute;left:6.5%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:min(32vw,430px);max-width:430px;z-index:3;color:var(--hero-ink,#fff7e7);pointer-events:auto}
.hero-name{display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:clamp(142px,15vw,176px);font-size:0;line-height:0;margin:0 0 20px;overflow:visible;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(20,32,18,.22))}
.hero-intro{font-size:clamp(15px,1.22vw,18px);line-height:1.65;max-width:390px;margin:0;color:var(--hero-ink,#fffaf1);text-wrap:pretty}
.hero-meta{position:absolute;left:7.2%;bottom:7.5%;z-index:4;max-width:70%;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:var(--hero-ink,#fffaf1)}
.project-lane{position:absolute;left:44%;right:4%;top:8%;bottom:7%;z-index:2;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.portfolio-project-card{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:min(100%,920px);height:min(76svh,760px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(79,86,62,.14);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,253,247,1);box-shadow:0 18px 58px rgba(50,56,39,.13);transform:translate3d(-50%,-50%,0) scale(.86);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.portfolio-project-card.is-active{background:rgba(255,253,247,1);box-shadow:0 22px 62px rgba(50,56,39,.17)}
.project-card-image{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 58%;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(10px,1.2vw,16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(48,59,48,.08);background:#efede4}
.project-card-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center}
.project-card-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#eee6d6,#d9ded1 52%,#e6d7ca)}
.project-card-copy{box-sizing:border-box;flex:1 1 42%;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(7px,1vw,12px);padding:clamp(17px,2vw,27px) clamp(22px,2.4vw,34px);color:#303b30}
.project-card-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.project-card-index{display:block;margin:0;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(48,59,48,.62)}
.project-card-title{font-family:'Erode',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,2.3vw,34px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;color:#303b30;text-wrap:balance}
.project-card-subtitle{font-size:clamp(14px,1.08vw,16px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.36;margin:0;color:rgba(48,59,48,.9);text-wrap:pretty}.project-card-description{font-size:clamp(12px,.98vw,14px);line-height:1.5;max-width:680px;margin:0;color:rgba(48,59,48,.78);text-wrap:pretty}
.project-card-category{display:block;margin:0;text-align:right;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(48,59,48,.62)}
.sound-toggle{position:absolute;right:30px;bottom:24px;z-index:8;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.58);border-radius:30px;padding:9px 14px;background:rgba(22,36,25,.14);color:#fffaf1;font:500 10px Inter,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);cursor:pointer}
.sound-toggle:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff4dc;outline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero-copy{left:6%;width:33%;max-width:300px}.hero-name-text{font-size:clamp(48px,7.2vw,66px)}.hero-intro{font-size:clamp(13px,1.6vw,15px);line-height:1.55}.hero-meta{left:6%;max-width:36%;font-size:8px}.project-lane{left:43%;right:3%;top:10%;bottom:8%}.portfolio-project-card{width:96%;height:min(72svh,620px)}.project-card-image{flex-basis:56%;padding:10px}.project-card-copy{flex-basis:44%;gap:8px;padding:15px 18px}.project-card-title{font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,29px)}.project-card-subtitle{font-size:clamp(13px,1.7vw,15px)}.project-card-description{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.project-card-index,.project-card-category{font-size:8px}.sound-toggle{right:18px;bottom:16px}}
@media(max-width:680px){.portfolio-root{min-height:900vh}.portfolio-stage{top:0;height:100svh;min-height:550px;background-position:center 60%}.meadow-photo{background-position:center 60%;transform-origin:76% 30%}.portfolio-stage:after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,25,15,.24),transparent 36%,rgba(10,20,12,.3))}.hero-copy{left:7%;top:9%;transform:none;width:86%;max-width:unset}.hero-name{height:clamp(108px,30vw,126px);margin-bottom:10px}.hero-name-text{font-size:clamp(50px,13vw,64px)}.hero-meta{left:7%;top:32%;bottom:auto;max-width:84%;font-size:8px;line-height:1.45}.hero-intro{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:340px}.project-lane{left:4%;right:4%;top:42%;height:54%;bottom:auto}.portfolio-project-card{width:94%;height:94%;border-radius:13px}.project-card-image{flex:0 0 45%;padding:8px}.project-card-copy{flex:1 1 55%;gap:6px;padding:10px 14px 12px}.project-card-meta{gap:6px}.project-card-index,.project-card-category{font-size:7px}.project-card-title{font-size:clamp(19px,5.2vw,23px);line-height:1.06}.project-card-subtitle{font-size:12px;line-height:1.3}.project-card-description{font-size:11px;line-height:1.38}.sound-toggle{bottom:12px;right:12px;font-size:9px;padding:8px 11px}.optic-ring.one{width:68vw;height:68vw;left:1%;top:18%}.optic-ring.two{width:48vw;height:48vw;left:48%;top:33%}.optic-ring.three{width:33vw;height:33vw;left:21%;top:40%}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.portfolio-root{height:auto!important;min-height:0!important}.portfolio-stage{position:relative!important;top:auto!important;height:auto!important;min-height:100svh;overflow:visible!important}.meadow-layer{position:sticky!important;top:0;height:100svh;margin-bottom:-100svh}.meadow-photo{transform:none!important;filter:none!important;will-change:auto!important}.scene-content{position:relative!important;inset:auto!important;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100svh}.hero-copy{position:relative!important;left:auto!important;top:auto!important;transform:none!important;width:min(86%,600px);max-width:600px;margin:0 7%;padding-top:15svh}.hero-meta{position:relative!important;left:auto!important;bottom:auto!important;max-width:86%;margin:6vh 7% 8vh}.gradient-transition,.transition-optics{position:fixed!important}.project-lane{position:relative!important;left:auto!important;right:auto!important;top:auto!important;bottom:auto!important;width:100%;height:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;margin-top:100svh;padding:0 4% 8vh;opacity:1!important;visibility:visible!important;overflow:visible!important;pointer-events:auto!important}.portfolio-project-card{position:relative!important;left:auto!important;top:auto!important;width:min(100%,1080px);height:600px;min-height:600px;transform:none!important;opacity:1!important;visibility:visible!important;pointer-events:auto!important;margin:0 auto;will-change:auto}.project-card-image{flex:0 0 58%}.project-card-copy{flex:1 1 42%}.sound-toggle{position:fixed;bottom:16px;right:16px;transition:none}}</style><div class="portfolio-stage" style="--meadow-shade: 1; --sunlight-field-opacity: 0; --sunlight-field-scale: 1.0000; --hero-ink: #fff7e7;"><div class="meadow-layer" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="meadow-photo" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(27, 38, 28, 0.06), rgba(27, 38, 28, 0.03)), url('../framerusercontent.com/images/50uIRoagjEMc64cP6lfMZCgBbmI.png'); transform: none; filter: none; will-change: auto;"></div><canvas class="grass-canvas" aria-hidden="true" width="907" height="1433"></canvas><div class="ray-layer"><div style="position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none;"><canvas aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%;"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="gradient-transition" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="gradient-ascii-container" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none;"><canvas aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%;" width="1457" height="2300"></canvas></div></div><div class="transition-optics" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.98);"><span class="optic-ring one"></span><span class="optic-ring two"></span><span class="optic-ring three"></span></div><div class="scene-content"><div class="hero-copy"><h1 class="hero-name" aria-label="Janya Malhotra"><span class="hero-name-text"><span>Janya</span><span>Malhotra</span></span><canvas class="hero-name-ascii-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></h1><p class="profile-bio">Third-year B.Des Human-Centered Design student at <a href="https://srishti-manipalinstitute.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="profile-link">Srishti Manipal Institute of Art, Design and Technology</a>.</p><p class="profile-practice">I'm a human-centred designer interested in the space between what people need and what they're drawn to. I look beyond expressed wants to understand the needs beneath them, exploring how design can make addressing those needs feel natural, relevant and desirable.</p><div class="profile-contact"><a href="mailto:janya.malhotra2@gmail.com" class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon">✉</span><span>janya.malhotra2@gmail.com</span></a><a href="assets/Janya-Malhotra-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" download="Janya-Malhotra-Resume.pdf" class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon">↓</span><span>Download Resume (PDF)</span></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/janya-malhotra-2a85aa438" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon">↗</span><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div><div class="profile-footer">© 2026 Janya Malhotra · All rights reserved.</div></div><section class="project-lane" aria-label="Project portfolio" style="opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none;"><nav class="project-progress-indicator" aria-label="Project sequence progress"><button type="button" class="progress-dot is-active" data-index="0" aria-label="Go to project 1: ISL Studio" title="ISL Studio"></button><button type="button" class="progress-dot" data-index="1" aria-label="Go to project 2: Image Toolset" title="Image Toolset"></button><button type="button" class="progress-dot" data-index="2" aria-label="Go to project 3: Sikka" title="Sikka"></button><button type="button" class="progress-dot" data-index="3" aria-label="Go to project 4: Talking Stage" title="Talking Stage"></button><button type="button" class="progress-dot" data-index="4" aria-label="Go to project 5: Freshline" title="Freshline"></button><button type="button" class="progress-dot" data-index="5" aria-label="Go to project 6: Slow Improvements" title="Slow Improvements"></button></nav><article class="portfolio-project-card is-active" data-index="0" aria-hidden="false" data-href="projects/isl-studio/" aria-label="01 of 06: ISL Studio" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #2E3B1C; border-color: rgba(197, 212, 165, 0.3); color: #F8F6EE; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, -50%, 0); opacity: 1; visibility: visible; z-index: 30; pointer-events: auto;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">01 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #C5D4A5">2026 · Semester 5</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #C5D4A5">Interactive ISL practice platform</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">ISL Studio</h2><p class="project-card-description">A working Indian Sign Language practice platform exploring how interactive technology might support repeated practice and improvement.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/qVDFpkTn5nMEeD6jPaJzb5Fc.png" alt="ISL Studio project image" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="portfolio-project-card" data-index="1" aria-hidden="true" data-href="projects/image-toolset/" aria-label="02 of 06: Image Toolset" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #5F7A2A; border-color: rgba(221, 232, 188, 0.35); color: #FAF8F0; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, calc(-50% + 800px), 0); opacity: 1; visibility: hidden; z-index: 11; pointer-events: none;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">02 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #DDE8BC">2026 · Semester 5</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #DDE8BC">Working creative tool</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">Image Toolset</h2><p class="project-card-description">An image-making tool for social media designers who want expressive image treatments without the time and skill demands of complex editing software.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/vKxiVJmQc4aXr39miRHBfsg6hE.png" alt="Image Toolset project image" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="portfolio-project-card" data-index="2" aria-hidden="true" data-href="projects/sikka/" aria-label="03 of 06: Sikka" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #8C8A3A; border-color: rgba(244, 240, 218, 0.4); color: #FCFBF4; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, calc(-50% + 800px), 0); opacity: 1; visibility: hidden; z-index: 12; pointer-events: none;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">03 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #FFFFFF">2025 · Semester 3</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #FFFFFF">Financial literacy app</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">Sikka</h2><p class="project-card-description">A Financial Literacy App designed to help young adults to know about finance literacy through games, fun articles, blogs, and reels.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/UTaWoRlQBMZD1JHaFXtCsT88E.png" alt="Sikka project image" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="portfolio-project-card" data-index="3" aria-hidden="true" data-href="projects/talking-stage/" aria-label="04 of 06: Talking Stage" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #D8A446; border-color: rgba(50, 40, 20, 0.15); color: #1E2B12; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, calc(-50% + 800px), 0); opacity: 1; visibility: hidden; z-index: 13; pointer-events: none;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">04 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #384820">Year 1 · Semester 2</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #384820">Conversation board game</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">Talking Stage</h2><p class="project-card-description">A board game for 2–5 players that encourages people to get to know one another through questions, strategy and play.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/kUfKIAUPfE8yY3n1xwPQSdHg3k.png" alt="Talking Stage project image" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="portfolio-project-card" data-index="4" aria-hidden="true" data-href="projects/freshline/" aria-label="05 of 06: Freshline" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #EBCB96; border-color: rgba(60, 50, 30, 0.12); color: #1E2B12; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, calc(-50% + 800px), 0); opacity: 1; visibility: hidden; z-index: 14; pointer-events: none;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">05 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #425528">2024 · POU 2</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #425528">Speculative service concept</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">Freshline</h2><p class="project-card-description">This Vertical Farm Mobile Van business is designed to bridge the gap between locally grown, fresh produce and urban consumers, creating direct access between vertical farms and the community.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/BVS7Ui8DSGU6niZ3UDkxZMVhJE.jpg" alt="Freshline project image" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="portfolio-project-card" data-index="5" aria-hidden="true" data-href="projects/slow-improvements/" aria-label="06 of 06: Slow Improvements" tabIndex="0" style="background-color: #F6EFDD; border-color: rgba(60, 60, 40, 0.12); color: #1E2B12; will-change: auto; transform: translate3d(-50%, calc(-50% + 800px), 0); opacity: 1; visibility: hidden; z-index: 15; pointer-events: none;"><div class="project-card-header"><div class="project-card-meta"><div class="project-card-meta-left"><span class="project-card-index">06 / 06</span><span class="project-card-year" style="color: #4B5E32">2026 · Semester 4</span></div><div class="project-card-meta-right"><span class="project-card-category" style="color: #4B5E32">Podcast and companion platform</span><span class="project-card-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="project-card-divider"></div><h2 class="project-card-title">Slow Improvements</h2><p class="project-card-description">A podcast and companion platform proposing small, intentional changes as an alternative to the pressure of instant self-improvement.</p></div><div class="project-card-image"><img src="../framerusercontent.com/images/793P1J5iWjHKouPZwExf3MWgs.png" alt="Slow Improvements project image" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article></section></div><button class="sound-toggle is-unmuted" type="button" aria-label="Mute sound" title="Mute sound"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="sound-icon"><path d="M11 5L6 9H2v6h4l5 4V5zM15.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7M19 5a9.5 9.5 0 0 1 0 14"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="framer-118oocv" data-border="true" data-framer-name="Contact — Future Section" id="contact">
